A patch made with git diff -U0, so no hunk has context and a side is often
empty: an insertion, a deletion and an append in the middle and at the end
of a file. An empty range is written as the line before it, which moves
the other side's start by one. See test/corpus.ts.

diff --git a/lines.txt b/lines.txt
index e031777..c96e95a 100644
--- a/lines.txt
+++ b/lines.txt
@@ -3,0 +4,2 @@ three
+inserted-a
+inserted-b
@@ -8 +9,0 @@ seven
-eight
@@ -12,0 +14 @@ twelve
+appended
